The package contains 18 dataset versions. Names ending in \code{_e1} refer to the first edition (Hosmer and Lemeshow, 1999), and those ending in \code{_e2} to the second edition (Hosmer, Lemeshow, and May, 2008). Every dataset has its own help page with variable definitions, category codes, units, endpoints, and provenance.

